            <h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px;">The ideal solution for small- to medium-sized critical power IT applications</h2>
            <p>The DPA UPScale ST can be deployed in a variety of small- to medium-sized system architectures. In addition to traditional server load applications, the DPA UPScale ST is ideal to protect critical applications such as building management systems (BMS). Large facilities are often provided with BMS to control and monitor the building’s mechanical and electrical systems such as ventilation, lighting, fire alarms and security. The BMS is designed to create and maintain a safe, productive and comfortable environment, thus increasing operational efficiency, decreasing the energy consumption and ensuring the safety of personnel and equipment.</p>
